type: article
title: "A Pre-Registered Test of Entropy–Structure Coupling in Simulated and Observed Galaxy Clusters"
authors:
  - family-names: "Magnusson"
    given-names: "Morten"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-4860-5095"
date-released: 2026-02-01
